  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add the sofrito and cook, stirring occasionally, until fragrant, about 3-4 minutes.",
    "Add the chickpeas, coriander seeds, smoked paprika, cumin powder, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Stir to combine, then cook for an additional 2-3 minutes, until the chickpeas start to brown.",
    "Increase the heat to high and cook, stirring constantly, until the chickpeas are crispy and golden brown, about 5-7 minutes.",
    "Remove from heat and let cool slightly.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with chopped fresh coriander if desired."
